<h1>Business Analytics for Ecommerce: 10 KPIs to Track and How to Act on Them (2026)</h1>
<p class="meta">By Tycoon Clap · Published October 20, 2026 · 11 min read</p>

<div class="summary">
<strong>Quick answer:</strong> The 10 ecommerce KPIs worth tracking are revenue and orders, conversion rate, average order value, cart abandonment rate, customer acquisition cost, return on ad spend, customer lifetime value, repeat purchase rate, gross margin and return rate. Track them on one dashboard, review them weekly, and always ask what decision each number should change.
</div>

